OL,3,GNEWSADangerous drivers jailed for mum
OL,4,Aand girl's deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been jailed for causing
OL,7,Fthe deaths of a mother and her
OL,8,Ffour-year-old daughter in a crash in
OL,9,FLeeds.
OL,11,FJustyna Hulboj, 27, and her daughter
OL,12,FLena Czepczor were killed when they
OL,13,Fwere hit by an Audi TT RS as they
OL,14,Fwalked to the girl's nursery on 16
OL,15,FJanuary 2023.
OL,17,FAt Leeds Crown Court on Monday, Hardeep
OL,18,FBhachu, 29, was jailed for 12 years and
OL,19,FJasskamal Riyat, 37, for 16 years.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
